{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist Shopify footer section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact visual reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different footer layout. Reproduce the same dark olive background, four-column structure, typography, spacing, social icons, payment badges and bottom legal navigation.
    
    1. OVERALL FOOTER DESIGN
    
    Full-width Shopify footer.
    
    Background colour: dark olive charcoal (#383F2A).
    
    Text colour: warm cream (#E8E5D6).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 55px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 55px 55px 25px.
    
    Four-column desktop layout.
    
    Premium, minimal, editorial babywear aesthetic.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients.
    
    No prominent shadows.
    
    No unnecessary decorative elements.
    
    2. DESKTOP FOUR-COLUMN LAYOUT
    
    Create exactly four columns with the following approximate proportions:
    
    Column 1 – Brand information: 30%.
    
    Column 2 – Shop navigation: 18%.
    
    Column 3 – Explore navigation: 18%.
    
    Column 4 – Get in touch: 34%.
    
    Column alignment:
    
    All columns aligned to the top.
    
    Consistent horizontal spacing.
    
    Left-aligned text.
    
    Vertically balanced content.
    
    Keep the footer compact, just like the reference.
    
    3. COLUMN 1 – BRAND INFORMATION
    
    Brand heading:
    
    "Kiss and Kry"
    
    Font: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Size: 21px.
    
    Colour: #F5F3E7.
    
    Margin-bottom: 12px.
    
    Brand description:
    
    "Born from bamboo. Made for baby. Ultra soft, naturally breathable essentials for every kiss and every cry."
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Colour: muted cream (#C7C8B8).
    
    Maximum width: 240px.
    
    SOCIAL MEDIA ICONS
    
    Below the description, display four circular social media icons in one horizontal row.
    
    Instagram
    
    Facebook
    
    YouTube
    
    Pinterest
    
    Design:
    
    Circle size: 32px.
    
    Transparent background.
    
    Thin olive-grey border (#727861).
    
    Icon colour: muted cream (#D7D8C9).
    
    Gap: 9px.
    
    Minimal outline appearance.
    
    No filled backgrounds.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Instagram: configurable Instagram profile URL.
    
    Facebook: configurable Facebook URL.
    
    YouTube: configurable YouTube channel URL.
    
    Pinterest: configurable Pinterest URL.
    
    Open external links in a new tab.
    
    Use inline SVG icons or a lightweight icon library.
    
    4. COLUMN 2 – SHOP NAVIGATION
    
    Heading:
    
    "SHOP"
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Margin-bottom: 15px.
    
    Navigation links:
    
    Bodysuits
    
    Footies
    
    Rompers
    
    Crib sheets
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Line height: 2.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    No bullet points.
    
    No underlines by default.
    
    Subtle cream hover colour.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Each link must have an editable Shopify navigation URL.
    
    Links should point to the corresponding product collections.
    
    5. COLUMN 3 – EXPLORE NAVIGATION
    
    Heading:
    
    "EXPLORE"
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Margin-bottom: 15px.
    
    Navigation links:
    
    Why bamboo
    
    Our story
    
    Reviews
    
    Care guide
    
    FAQ
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Line height: 2.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    No bullet points.
    
    Subtle hover transition.
    
    Functionality:
    
    All links must be clickable.
    
    Allow editable destination URLs through the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Link to the corresponding website pages or page sections.
    
    6. COLUMN 4 – GET IN TOUCH
    
    Heading:
    
    "GET IN TOUCH"
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Margin-bottom: 15px.
    
    Create three contact rows with small icons., Contact 1
    
    Icon: WhatsApp outline icon.
    
    Text:
    "Chat on WhatsApp"
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Editable WhatsApp phone number.
    
    Link to WhatsApp using a wa.me URL.
    
    Open in a new tab.
    
    Contact 2
    
    Icon: Envelope outline icon.
    
    Text:
    "Send us an email"
    
    Functionality:
    
    Editable customer support email.
    
    Use mailto link.
    
    Contact 3
    
    Icon: Instagram outline icon.
    
    Text:
    "@kissandkry"
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the official Instagram profile.
    
    Open in a new tab.
    
    Contact styling:
    
    Icon size: 13px.
    
    Icon colour: mustard yellow (#DDAA32).
    
    Text colour: #C7C8B8.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Vertical spacing: 12px.
    
    Align icons and text horizontally.
    
    7. FOOTER DIVIDER
    
    Below all four columns, create a thin horizontal divider.
    
    Width: 100%.
    
    Height: 1px.
    
    Colour: #4C533B.
    
    Opacity: 70%.
    
    Margin-top: 45px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 20px.
    
    The divider should span the full content width.
    
    8. BOTTOM FOOTER BAR
    
    Create a single horizontal row divided into three sections.
    
    LEFT – COPYRIGHT
    
    Text:
    
    "© 2026 Kiss and Kry. All rights reserved."
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #AEB09D.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    CENTRE – PAYMENT METHOD BADGES
    
    Display five small payment badges horizontally.
    
    Badges:
    
    UPI
    
    VISA
    
    MASTERCARD
    
    RUPAY
    
    COD
    
    Design:
    
    Small rounded rectangular badges.
    
    Background: #4A503B.
    
    Text/icon colour: #E1E1D5.
    
    Height: 25px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 10px.
    
    Border radius: 6px.
    
    Gap: 6px.
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 8px.
    
    Use appropriate payment logos where available.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    Only display payment methods supported by the store. Make the payment badges configurable.
    
    RIGHT – LEGAL LINKS
    
    Display three links in one horizontal row:
    
    Privacy policy
    
    Terms of service
    
    Refund policy
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #AEB09D.
    
    Horizontal spacing: 18px.
    
    No underlines by default.
    
    Subtle hover colour: #F5F3E7.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the corresponding Shopify policy pages.
    
    Use Shopify's native policy URLs where available.
    
    9. EXACT COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use these colours throughout:
    
    Footer background: #383F2A
    
    Primary heading: #F5F3E7
    
    Secondary text: #C7C8B8
    
    Muted text: #AEB09D
    
    Accent yellow: #DDAA32
    
    Social icon border: #727861
    
    Divider: #4C533B
    
    Payment badge background: #4A503B
    
    10. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat exclusively.
    
    Brand name: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Column headings: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Navigation links: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Description: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Contact information: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Copyright: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Payment badges: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Maintain a clean and premium typography hierarchy.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign whatsapp_digits = block.settings.whatsapp_phone | remove: '+' | remove: ' ' | remove: '-' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' %}
{% style %}
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:100%; background:#383F2A; color:#C7C8B8; box-sizing:border-box; font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  .ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width:100%; max-width:1310px; margin:0 auto; padding:55px 55px 25px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:grid; grid-template-columns:30fr 18fr 18fr 34fr; column-gap:38px; align-items:start; }
  .ai-kry-footer__brand-{{ ai_gen_id }} { max-width:290px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__brand-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} { color:#F5F3E7; font-size:21px; line-height:1.25; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 12px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__description-{{ ai_gen_id }} { max-width:240px; margin:0; color:#C7C8B8; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; line-height:1.6; }
  .ai-kry-footer__socials-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; gap:9px; margin-top:21px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__social-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width:32px; height:32px; border:1px solid #727861; border-radius:50%; color:#D7D8C9; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; text-decoration:none; }
  .ai-kry-footer__social-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { width:15px; height:15px; fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.5; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; }
  .ai-kry-footer__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} { color:#DDAA32; font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:2px; line-height:1.4; margin:2px 0 15px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__links-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  .ai-kry-footer__links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a { color:#C7C8B8; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; line-height:2; text-decoration:none; transition:color .18s ease; }
  .ai-kry-footer__links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover,.ai-kry-footer__contact-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover { color:#F5F3E7; }
  .ai-kry-footer__contact-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { width:13px; height:13px; flex:0 0 13px; color:#DDAA32; fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.6; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; }
  .ai-kry-footer__contact-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} { color:#C7C8B8; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; line-height:1.6; text-decoration:none; }
  .ai-kry-footer__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} { height:1px; width:100%; background:#4C533B; opacity:.7; margin:45px 0 20px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr; align-items:center; column-gap:20px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }} { color:#AEB09D; margin:0; font-size:9px; line-height:1.6; }
  .ai-kry-footer__payments-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  .ai-kry-footer__payment-{{ ai_gen_id }} { height:25px; min-width:40px; padding:0 10px; border-radius:6px; background:#4A503B; color:#E1E1D5; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:8px; line-height:1; font-weight:600; }
  .ai-kry-footer__payment-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { display:block; width:auto; height:15px; max-width:48px; fill:#E1E1D5; }
  .ai-kry-footer__legal-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; justify-content:flex-end; gap:18px; margin:0; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  .ai-kry-footer__legal-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a { color:#AEB09D; font-size:9px; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap; }
  .ai-kry-footer__legal-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover { color:#F5F3E7; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #F5F3E7; outline-offset:3px; }
  @media(max-width:900px) { .ai-kry-footer__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} { column-gap:22px; } .ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-left:32px; padding-right:32px; } }
  @media(max-width:749px) {
    .ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding:40px 24px 22px; }
    .ai-kry-footer__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:32px 24px; }
    .ai-kry-footer__brand-{{ ai_gen_id }} { grid-column:1 / -1; }
    .ai-kry-footer__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} { margin:32px 0 18px; }
    .ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} { grid-template-columns:1fr; justify-items:start; row-gap:14px; }
    .ai-kry-footer__payments-{{ ai_gen_id }} { justify-content:flex-start; grid-row:2; }
    .ai-kry-footer__legal-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} { justify-content:flex-start; gap:12px 18px; }
  }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .ai-kry-footer__links-{{ ai_gen_id }} a { transition:none; } }
{% endstyle %}
<footer class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-kry-footer__grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-kry-footer__brand-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <h2 class="ai-kry-footer__brand-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.brand_title | escape }}</h2>
        <p class="ai-kry-footer__description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p>
        <div class="ai-kry-footer__socials-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.instagram_url != blank %}<a class="ai-kry-footer__social-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.facebook_url != blank %}<a class="ai-kry-footer__social-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.facebook_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 8h3V4h-3c-3 0-5 2-5 5v2H6v4h3v5h4v-5h3l1-4h-4V9c0-.7.3-1 1-1z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.youtube_url != blank %}<a class="ai-kry-footer__social-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.youtube_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 8a2.5 2.5 0 0 0-1.7-1.8C17.8 5.8 12 5.8 12 5.8s-5.8 0-7.3.4A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 3 8a26 26 0 0 0 0 8 2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1.7 1.8c1.5.4 7.3.4 7.3.4s5.8 0 7.3-.4A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 21 16a26 26 0 0 0 0-8z"/><path d="m10 15 5-3-5-3z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.pinterest_url != blank %}<a class="ai-kry-footer__social-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.pinterest_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Pinterest"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3a9 9 0 0 0-3.3 17.4c0-.8 0-1.8.2-2.7l1.2-5.2s-.3-.6-.3-1.5c0-1.4.8-2.4 1.8-2.4.9 0 1.3.7 1.3 1.5 0 .9-.6 2.2-.9 3.5-.3 1 .5 1.8 1.5 1.8 1.8 0 3.1-2.3 3.1-5.1 0-2.1-1.4-3.7-4-3.7-2.9 0-4.7 2.2-4.7 4.6 0 .8.2 1.4.6 1.9.2.2.2.3.1.6l-.2.8c-.1.3-.3.4-.6.3-1.3-.5-1.9-1.9-1.9-3.4 0-2.5 2.1-5.6 6.4-5.6 3.4 0 5.6 2.5 5.6 5.2 0 3.6-2 6.3-5 6.3-1 0-2-.6-2.3-1.2l-.7 2.8c-.2 1-.7 1.9-1.1 2.7A9 9 0 1 0 12 3z"/></svg></a>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Shop"><h3 class="ai-kry-footer__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.shop_heading | escape }}</h3><ul class="ai-kry-footer__links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.shop_link_1 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.shop_link_1 }}">{{ block.settings.shop_label_1 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.shop_link_2 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.shop_link_2 }}">{{ block.settings.shop_label_2 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.shop_link_3 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.shop_link_3 }}">{{ block.settings.shop_label_3 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.shop_link_4 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.shop_link_4 }}">{{ block.settings.shop_label_4 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}
      </ul></nav>
      <nav aria-label="Explore"><h3 class="ai-kry-footer__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.explore_heading | escape }}</h3><ul class="ai-kry-footer__links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.explore_link_1 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.explore_link_1 }}">{{ block.settings.explore_label_1 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.explore_link_2 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.explore_link_2 }}">{{ block.settings.explore_label_2 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.explore_link_3 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.explore_link_3 }}">{{ block.settings.explore_label_3 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.explore_link_4 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.explore_link_4 }}">{{ block.settings.explore_label_4 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.explore_link_5 != blank %}<li><a href="{{ block.settings.explore_link_5 }}">{{ block.settings.explore_label_5 | escape }}</a></li>{% endif %}
      </ul></nav>
      <div><h3 class="ai-kry-footer__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.contact_heading | escape }}</h3><div class="ai-kry-footer__contact-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if whatsapp_digits != blank %}<div class="ai-kry-footer__contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.5 11.7a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-12.6 7.4L3 20l.9-4.7a8.5 8.5 0 1 1 16.6-3.6z"/><path d="M8.5 8.2c.3-.7.6-.7 1-.7h.4c.2 0 .4.1.5.5l.7 1.7c.1.3.1.4-.1.6l-.5.6c-.2.2-.2.4 0 .6.4.8 1.1 1.5 1.9 1.9.2.1.4.1.6-.1l.7-.8c.2-.2.4-.2.6-.1l1.6.8c.3.2.4.3.4.5 0 .3-.2 1.1-.7 1.5-.5.4-1.1.7-1.8.6-1-.1-2.3-.7-3.8-2-1.3-1.2-2.2-2.7-2.4-3.6-.2-.9 0-1.6.3-2z"/></svg><a class="ai-kry-footer__contact-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="https://wa.me/{{ whatsapp_digits }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ block.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.email != blank %}<div class="ai-kry-footer__contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg><a class="ai-kry-footer__contact-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="mailto:{{ block.settings.email | escape }}">{{ block.settings.email_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.contact_instagram_url != blank %}<div class="ai-kry-footer__contact-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg><a class="ai-kry-footer__contact-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="{{ block.settings.contact_instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ block.settings.instagram_label | escape }}</a></div>{% endif %}
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-kry-footer__divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <p class="ai-kry-footer__copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }}">© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ block.settings.brand_title | escape }}. {{ block.settings.copyright_text | escape }}</p>
      {% if block.settings.show_payments %}<ul class="ai-kry-footer__payments-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Accepted payment methods">{% for type in shop.enabled_payment_types %}<li class="ai-kry-footer__payment-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ type | payment_type_svg_tag }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
      <ul class="ai-kry-footer__legal-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{% if shop.privacy_policy != blank %}<li><a href="{{ shop.privacy_policy.url }}">Privacy policy</a></li>{% endif %}{% if shop.terms_of_service != blank %}<li><a href="{{ shop.terms_of_service.url }}">Terms of service</a></li>{% endif %}{% if shop.refund_policy != blank %}<li><a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">Refund policy</a></li>{% endif %}</ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
{% schema %}
{
  "name":"Kiss and Kry footer",
  "settings":[
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"header","content":"Brand information"},
    {"type":"text","id":"brand_title","label":"Brand name","default":"Kiss and Kry"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"description","label":"Description","default":"Born from bamboo. Made for baby. Ultra soft, naturally breathable essentials for every kiss and every cry."},
